 "description": "The LS2 HSM Family module by Marvell is a high-performance purpose-built security solution for key management and crypto acceleration. The module provides a FIPS 140-3 overall Level 3 security solution. The module is deployed in a PCIe slot to provide crypto and protocol acceleration in a secure manner to the system host. It is typically deployed in a server or an appliance to provide crypto offload for the keys stored on the HSM. The module's functions are accessed over the PCIe interface via opcode defined by the module.",
